  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT activiteitennummer  230000257 Talent Acceleration Program (TAP) Nexus Skills and Jobs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the Talent Acceleration Program, TAP will train 200 individuals in 2023 and 400 individuals in 2024 with over 25 cohorts and a job placement rate of 80%. Of which 400 in total will be trained with RAM financing. The target group of individuals will be: recent graduates of Palestinian Universities or TVET institutions or individuals in unsatisfactory jobs. The program will target both West Bank and Gaza and will aim to train individuals in professional skills as well as programs on relevant economic remote job sectors such as digital marketing, B2B sales, web development and mid-level IT skills. By providing a 3 month training, coaching and career advice chances will improve on the labour market.</narrative>
  </description>
